(text "Root sheet. Vimal adds power.kicad_sch and test.kicad_sch here as more sheets. The PWR_FLAGs below are TEMPORARY so ERC passes before the power sheet exists: delete them once the LDO outputs drive AVDD_ADC, AVDD_FE and IOVDD (VOCM is driven by U3 on the ADC sheet but needs a flag because a 100R sits between)." (at 20 120 0)
